BT 1 0 0 1 0 30 Tm /F1 9 Tf 13 TL (BACKGROUND: Generalized anxiety disorder \(GAD\) is one of the most common mental disorders; however, there is) Tj T* (no brief clinical measure for assessing GAD. The objective of this study was to develop a brief self-report scale to) Tj T* (identify probable cases of GAD and evaluate its reliability and validity.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
