BT 1 0 0 1 0 56 Tm /F1 9 Tf 13 TL (METHODS: A criterion-standard study was performed in 15 primary care clinics in the United States from November) Tj T* (2004 through June 2005. Of a total of 2740 adult patients completing a study questionnaire, 965 patients had a) Tj T* (telephone interview with a mental health professional within 1 week. For criterion and construct validity, GAD self-report) Tj T* (scale diagnoses were compared with independent diagnoses made by mental health professionals; functional status) Tj T* (measures; disability days; and health care use.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
